# `:help exclusive`: an exclusive motion ending in column 1 moves its end
# to the previous line's end, inclusive. Neovim: w mb j d`b on "abc def/x"
# -> "abc " / "x". mnml also deletes the line break -> "abc x".
write f.txt "abc def\nx\n"
open f.txt
command editor.use_vim
key w
key m
key b
key j
key d
key `
key b
ex w
expect file f.txt contains "abc \nx\n"
